'''Pumpkin Guts''' are an {{Uncommon}} item that can be obtained only from [[Trick or Treat Chest]]s. It is used in crafting the {{Item|Spooky Sack}}, {{Item|Pumpkin Launcher}} and {{Item|Blast o' Lantern}}s.

== Obtaining ==
'''Pumpkin Guts''' have a 4.1<span style="text-decoration:overline;">6</span>% chance to drop from a {{Mctxt|6|TREAT}} [[Trick or Treat Chest]]. Seeing as Trick or Treat Chests have a 75% chance to be the {{Mctxt|6|TREAT}} variation, this means that the overall chance to drop '''Pumpkin Guts''' from any [[Trick or Treat Chest]] is 3.125%.

Alternatively, '''Pumpkin Guts''' have a 4.14% chance to drop from a [[Party Chest]] in quantities of 1-2.

